hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"90","Asbahna [amsayna] 'ala fitrat al-islam, wa 'ala kalimat al-ikhlas, wa 'ala din nabiyyina Muhammad, wa 'ala millat abina Ibrahim hanifan musliman wa ma kana min al-mushrikin.. We have reached the morning [evening] upon the natural disposition of Islam, upon the word of sincerity, upon the religion of our Prophet Muhammad, and upon the way of our father Abraham, who was a devout Muslim and was not among the polytheists."
"91","Subhaana Allahi wa bihamdihi. (Mi’ata marrah). Glory be to Allah and praise Him. (One hundred times)"
